        "language": "english",
        "review": "It's painful to hurt something that looks to have had so much love put into it but this feels like an Early Access release. There is a great game hidden between a copious amounts of bugs, bloated pool of bland upgrades and poorly designed progression. \"Runs\" are split into three sections which often end too quickly before you actually start to feel the interesting scaling augments kick in. Some rooms are so tiny that it feels like you're in a hedge maze. You could beat the story in less than a couple hours and that's basically all the game has to offer at the moment.\nIt really is a shame because the guns are fun to use, the movement feels nice and the art is a breath of fresh air.\n\nI really hope they continue to put more into this because right now I do not think it is worth the price tag.",
